        "backend_type": "k8s-secure-gov",
        "service_type": "kubernetes-cluster",
        "deployment_mode": "managed",
        "security_hardening": true,
        "audit_logging": true,
        "service_provider_can_create_offering_user": true
      },
      "getting_started": "## Getting Started with Secure Kubernetes Cluster\n\n### Security Requirements\n1. **Government-issued SSH keys required**\n2. All API access is logged and audited\n3. Pod Security Standards enforced (restricted mode)\n\n### Access\n```\nexport KUBECONFIG=~/Downloads/kubeconfig-secure.yaml\nkubectl get nodes\n```\n\n### Compliance Features\n- ISO 27001 certified infrastructure\n- GDPR-compliant data residency (EU only)\n- Audit logs retained for 7 years\n- Network policies enforced by default\n\nContact security@gov.cloud for compliance questions."
    },
    {
      "uuid": "f1000000000000000000000000000020",
