        "service_provider_can_create_offering_user": true
      },
      "getting_started": "## Getting Started with HA Government Kubernetes\n\n### Multi-Datacenter Architecture\n- Primary: Tallinn, Estonia\n- Secondary: Frankfurt, Germany\n- Automatic failover with 99.99% SLA\n\n### Access\n```\nexport KUBECONFIG=~/Downloads/kubeconfig-ha-gov.yaml\nkubectl get nodes --label-columns=topology.kubernetes.io/zone\n```\n\n### Disaster Recovery\n- RPO: 5 minutes\n- RTO: 15 minutes\n- Automatic cross-DC replication\n\n### Compliance\n- All traffic encrypted with government-approved algorithms\n- Data sovereignty guaranteed (EU only)\n\nContact security@gov.cloud for DR testing requests."
